The '''Liberty Equality Brotherhood''' were a group of soldiers who hid in the [[Paris Catacombs]] during the French Revolution. An archaeologist served as a guide to show them around the catacombs. In their chest of tools, [[Lok Lambert]] found a scroll with an image from [[Eathon Lambert's journal]] on it. {{source|Divide and Conquer}}
